Your product: {{ $json.mine.product_name }} ({{ $json.mine.product_rating }} stars)
Top complaints about yours: {{ JSON.stringify($json.mine.complaints) }}
What buyers praise about yours: {{ JSON.stringify($json.mine.praise) }}
Competitors and their themes: {{ JSON.stringify($json.rivals) }}
Themes you are criticised for and a rival is praised for: {{ JSON.stringify($json.gaps) }}

Write a short brief in plain prose, no more than 200 words:
1. The single most damaging complaint and what it is costing.
2. The clearest competitive gap and which rival wins on it.
3. One thing your product is genuinely beating them on, worth protecting.
4. The one change you would make first.

Base every statement on the themes above. If the evidence is thin, say so
rather than inventing a finding. Do not use bullet points or headings.

